abstract: "HunterX is an open-source AI-assisted vulnerability scanner and security assessment platform. It combines a Security Skills Framework (41 skills), Reasoning Engine (18 goal types), Multi-Agent Platform (10 agents), AI Provider Abstraction, Knowledge Graph, Threat Modeling, Attack Chain Analysis, and Payload Intelligence into a single extensible platform."
